# Negative control: `attach_cpu_hz` re-applying the same clock must keep the phase.
#
# Applied to the PR head after the review nit: replace the early return
#
#     if hz == 0 || hz == self.cpu_hz { return; }
#
# with
#
#     if hz == 0 { return; }
#
# which resets `cycle_accum` on every re-attach of the shipped 128 MHz clock.
# Same binary command as the positive run: every slice leaves a remainder, so
